@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@ The format follows [Keep a Changelog 1.1.0](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/
 
 ### Added
 
+- Click attribution (R-03, T-202): each click records the lower-cased host of the `Referer` header and the `utm_source`, `utm_medium` and `utm_campaign` parameters of the short link request, cleaned of control characters and bounded to the column widths; migration V3 adds the four nullable columns to `click_events` one `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN` at a time. No IP address, user agent, full referrer URL, geography or device value is stored (ADR 0006 unchanged).
+- `GET /api/v1/links/{code}/stats` returns `referrers` (host, clicks) and `campaigns` (source, medium, campaign, clicks), each at most ten rows ordered by clicks descending then name over all clicks of the link (T-202).
+- Edge-case table for `ClickAttribution.from` (case folding, trailing dots, IPv6 and userinfo referers, relative and opaque references, over-long hosts, duplicate, empty, whitespace, control-character and non-ASCII `utm_*` values), `AttributionIT` over HTTP, and the attribution section of `docs/reference/api.md` (T-203).
+
 ### Changed
 
